#showas:星系崛起
The other factions of the galaxy have gotten tired of you and the AI fighting, and want to take the galaxy for themselves.

The Devourer has allied itself with some Macrophages and two sets of Marauders to defeat both you and the AI.

The Dark Spire is (as always) trying to kill everyone.

Can you survive both two level 6 AIs and the Alliance of Minor Factions to rule the galaxy?